{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"chengguo-e-p160","title":"资让事推成不显己德","accounts":[{"id":"chengguo-a-60523ed25c42f61e6c54","label":"裴注·《资别传》","text":"资让事推成不显己德","evidence":["chengguo-q-1dfd0040b8f23795f5c3"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mingdi-p0075","role":"自以受腹心、常让事于帝曰动大众举大事宜与群下共之、朝臣会议奏当其是非择其善者推成之、众人有谴过及爱憎之说辄复为请解以塞谮润之端","evidence":["chengguo-q-1dfd0040b8f23795f5c3"]},{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"总摄群下、内图御寇之计外规庙胜之画资皆管之","evidence":["chengguo-q-1dfd0040b8f23795f5c3"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["chengguo-q-1dfd0040b8f23795f5c3"]},"ordering_evidence":"chengguo-q-1dfd0040b8f23795f5c3","source_order":[14,511,11],"order":3201}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0075","name":"孙资","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0005","name":"曹叡","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chengguo-q-1dfd0040b8f23795f5c3","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-e0d538a4c9d8de18da89","layer":"pei","quote":"是时，孙权、诸葛亮号称‘剧贼’，无岁不有军征。而帝总摄群下，内图御寇之计，外规庙胜之画，资皆管之。然自以受腹心，常让事于帝曰：‘动大众，举大事，宜与群下共之；既以示明，且于探求为广。’既朝臣会议，资奏当其是非，择其善者推成之，终不显己之德也","attribution":"裴注·《资别传》","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":510,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-dd527f858b45627ff07f","start":11,"end":131,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
